[{"id": 53053447, "text": "<b>Part 1: The Word</b>\n<ol>\n<li>Player 1 reads the word, e.g. <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">small</span>. </li>\n<li>Player 1 picks something they can see which is <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">small</span> (but doesn't tell Player 2). </li>\n<li>Player 1 says, \"I spy something <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">small</span>.\"</li>\n<li>Player 2 guesses what the thing might be. Player 1 can give ﻿clues to help, for example, 'It is next to the window,' or 'It is orange.'</li>\n</ol>\n<br></br>\n<b>Part 2: +er</b>\n<ol>\n<li>When Player 2 has correctly guessed, Player 1 adds 'er' to the end of the word: <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">smaller</span>. </li>\n<li>Player 1 picks something they can see which is <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">smaller</span> than the first thing they saw (but doesn't tell Player 2). </li>\n<li>Player 1 says, \"I spy something <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">smaller</span>.\"</li>\n<li>Player 2 guesses what the thing might be.</li>\n</ol>\n<br></br>\n<b>Part 3: +est</b>\n<ol>\n<li>When Player 2 has correctly guessed, Player 1 adds 'est' to the end of the original word: <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">smallest</span>. </li>\n<li>Both players have 20 seconds to think of the <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">smallest</span> thing they can see.</li>\n<li>After 20 seconds, Player 1 and Player 2 both say their idea and see whose was the <span style=\"color:#F28D00\">smallest</span>.</li>\n</ol>\n<br></br>\nWhen you have played all three parts, swap over using a new word from the box below.", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 53049231, "dimensions": null